  "11": {
   "printed": "All five species of Pacific salmon - chinook, or king; chum, or dog; coho, or silver; sockeye, or red; and pink, or humpback - spawn in Alaskan waters, and 90% of all Pacific salmon commercially caught in North America are produced there.",
   "review": "剑桥词典发音页的美式真人 sockeye 同样转写为 Sakai/Sakaay，单凭拼写不能判断错音。891835 的两个音节和 red 词尾完整，首音节与第二音节的声强关系却与美式参照不同。其余读音出现 Hawkeye、more、Ren 等分歧。保留全部实测用于比对，补录前不签收。",
